    - (ADD-ON) MATCH DATA : Calculate winrate from match history. check

     ** Should have a system that checks the champion pool once every 24 hours.

    - (USER) TRACK ACCOUNT : Adds a Riot Account to the User's tracking list
    Returns a Json with listed scouted accounts listed with AccountPreviewDTOs. This will later on be used for quick access

    - (USER) STOP TRACKING ACCOUNT : Removes selected Riot account from the tracked List
    If the account exists on the list

    - (USER) USER MAIN ACCOUNT : Users can add their main LOL account to their profile. This can later on be used for customization.